<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-NEW ZEALAND BARBARIANS BEAT ENGLAND 34-19.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NEW ZEALAND BARBARIANS BEAT ENGLAND 34-19.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Barbarians beat England 34-19 (halftime 6-9) at Twickenham on Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>NZ Barbarians - Tries: Robin Brooke, Andrew Blowers, Carlos Spencer, Joeli Vidiri. Conversion: Spencer. Penalties: Andrew Mehrtens (2), Spencer (2).</p>
<p>England - Tries: Jon Sleightholme, Tim Stimpson. Penalties: Mike Catt (3).</p>
